      {
        "type": "text",
        "content": "The film's influence extends deep into contemporary cinema. The meticulous planning sequence became a staple of the genre, echoed in films like <a href=\"/movie/500\" class=\"movie-title\" data-tmdb-id=\"500\">Reservoir Dogs</a> (1992) and <a href=\"/movie/388\" class=\"movie-title\" data-tmdb-id=\"388\">Inside Man</a> (2006). The character of the criminal mastermind, played by Sam Jaffe, influenced portrayals in <a href=\"/movie/11524\" class=\"movie-title\" data-tmdb-id=\"11524\">Thief</a> (1981) and <a href=\"/movie/949\" class=\"movie-title\" data-tmdb-id=\"949\">Heat</a> (1995). Even the film's tragic ending, where dreams of escape prove futile, remains a powerful template, seen in modern works like <a href=\"/movie/338766\" class=\"movie-title\" data-tmdb-id=\"338766\">Hell or High Water</a> (2016)."
      }
